OL,3,GNEWSACity centre car parks could become
OL,4,Ahousing
OL,5,
OL,6,FCar parks could be redeveloped to
OL,7,Fprovide hundreds of new homes in a city
OL,8,Fcentre where parking is already
OL,9,F"diabolical".
OL,11,FGloucester City Council is developing a
OL,12,Fnew masterplan to set out its
OL,13,Fregeneration vision for Gloucester,
OL,14,Fwhich would include strengthening the
OL,15,Fcity centre with redevelopments
OL,16,Fincluding more housing.
OL,18,FLongsmith Street, King's Walk, The
OL,19,FOxbode, Eastgate Shopping Centre and
OL,20,FLower Eastgate Street have been
OL,21,Fidentified by the council as areas with
OL,22,Fpotential for new housing.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
