OL,3,GNEWSACity centre car parks could become
OL,4,Ahousing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPam Tracey, Conservative councillor for
OL,7,FWestgate, raised concerns about the
OL,8,Fcurrent "diabolical" parking situation
OL,9,Fin Gloucester, adding: "People can't
OL,10,Fpark as it is, even going to the
OL,11,Frailway station."
